# =============================================================================
# 27_build_TBI_TRACT_manuscript_output_data.R
#
# PURPOSE
#   Build the canonical data layer for the final manuscript tables and figures
#   from the LOCKED forward-temporal prediction caches.
#
# IMPORTANT
#   This script does NOT fit or tune any model.
#   It only analyzes predictions already generated by the final locked models.
#
# OUTPUTS
#   - full year-specific classification metrics
#   - pooled rolling-origin forward-temporal evaluation metrics for 2022-2024
#   - 2024 bootstrap CIs for headline classification metrics
#   - flexible spline calibration-curve data
#   - duration performance + 2024 bootstrap CIs
#   - duration calibration-bin data
#   - temporal-performance figure data
#   - subgroup robustness heatmap data
#   - sociodemographic calibration-shift data
#   - key sensitivity summary data
#
# UNCERTAINTY
#   Bootstrap CIs are generated from the fixed rolling-origin forward-temporal evaluation predictions.
#   This quantifies sampling uncertainty of performance in the evaluation cohort;
#   it does not re-fit the full model-development procedure inside each bootstrap.
#
#   Default:
#       classification bootstrap B = 500
#       duration bootstrap B = 1000
#
#   Given the very large evaluation cohorts, these settings are adequate for
#   stable percentile intervals while remaining computationally practical.
# =============================================================================

